  "description": "Enhance your Umbraco CMS with AI-driven content generation.\nThis package integrates both Chat GPT and Stability APIs, providing a seamless UI for creating, managing, and customizing AI-generated text and images for your text and media properties. Gain more control over content with options for max words, model behavior, and easy content appending or replacement. In addition to image generation based on your input, the package also allows you to easily insert images from Google Search, giving you even more flexibility and creative power.",
